function companyPage(){return `${title('ABOUT GEOSR','자연환경을 연구하는<br>기술 전문기업','Environmental science<br>Engineering expertise','지오시스템리서치','GeoSystem Research Corporation')}
<nav class="company-anchor-nav" aria-label="${T('회사소개 항목','Company topics')}">${[['overview','기업 개요','Overview'],['professional-fields','전문 분야','Expertise'],['credential-library','인증·면허·지식재산권','Credentials'],['company-records','기업 정보','Company records'],['locations','거점 안내','Locations']].map(x=>`<a href="#${x[0]}">${T(x[1],x[2])}</a>`).join('')}</nav>
<section class="company-feature" id="overview"><div><p class="eyebrow">FIELD / SCIENCE / TECHNOLOGY</p><h2>${T('현장에서 묻고<br>연구로 답합니다','Grounded in the field<br>Driven by research')}</h2><p>${T('육상과 하천에서 연안과 해양까지<br>관측 조사와 환경 분석을 수행하고<br>수치모델과 AI 기술을 연구합니다','Observation and analysis across land, rivers and oceans<br>Research in numerical modelling and environmental AI')}</p></div>${img('coastal-model-v3.png',T('국내 연안 자료를 바탕으로 만든 수치모델 연출 가안','Modelling concept based on Korean coastal source imagery'),true)}</section>
<section class="company-fields section" id="professional-fields"><div class="section-heading"><h2>${T('분야를 잇는 전문성','Expertise across disciplines')}</h2><p>${T('사업의 목적과 현장의 조건에 맞는 기술을 연구하고 적용합니다','Research and technology shaped around field conditions and project requirements')}</p></div><div class="company-field-grid">${disciplines.map((d,i)=>`<a href="${d[7]===15?U('equipment',{category:'lab'}):U('business',{id:d[7]})}"><small>0${i+1}</small><h3>${T(d[0],d[1])}</h3><p>${T(d[4],d[5])}</p><span>↗</span></a>`).join('')}</div></section>
${credentialGallery()}
<section class="credential-library section" id="credential-library"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE RECORDS BEHIND OUR WORK</p><h2>${T('인증·면허·지식재산권','Certifications, licences & IP')}</h2></div><p>${T('분류와 검색으로 필요한 자료를 찾아보세요','Browse the collection by category or search')}</p></div><div class="library-toolbar"><div class="library-filters" role="group" aria-label="${T('자료 분류','Document categories')}">${[['all','전체','All'],['cert','인증','Certifications'],['license','면허·등록','Licences'],['patent','지식재산권','Intellectual property']].map((x,i)=>`<button type="button" data-credential-category="${x[0]}" aria-pressed="${i===0}">${T(x[1],x[2])}</button>`).join('')}</div><label class="library-search">${T('자료명 검색','Search documents')}<input type="search" id="credential-query" placeholder="${T('자료명을 입력하세요','Enter a document title')}"></label></div><p class="library-count" role="status"></p><div class="credential-grid"></div><p class="capture-context">${T('대표 자료 7건과 목업 자리만 구성했습니다 · 인증 유효기간과 전체 자료는 최종 이관 시 확인합니다','Seven representative records and layout placeholders · validity and full records will be checked during final migration')}</p></section>
<section class="company-records section" id="company-records"><div class="section-heading"><h2>${T('기업 정보','Company information')}</h2><p>${T('자료가 늘어나도 일관되게 탐색할 수 있는 구조','A consistent structure for the growing collection')}</p></div>${[['회사 연혁','Milestones','주요 연도와 사업의 기록','Key dates and corporate milestones'],['조직 안내','Organisation','분야별 조직과 역할 소개','Teams and areas of responsibility'],['회사소개서','Corporate brochure','국문·영문 소개서와 다운로드','Korean and English brochures'],['채용 안내','Careers','채용 공고와 지원 안내','Open positions and application information']].map(x=>`<details><summary><span>${T(x[0],x[1])}</span><em>${T('목업','DEMO')}</em><i>+</i></summary><div class="company-record-placeholder"><p>${T(x[2],x[3])}</p><p>${T('정식 자료가 들어갈 영역입니다','Reserved for verified corporate information')}</p></div></details>`).join('')}</section>
<section class="company-locations section" id="locations"><div class="section-heading"><h2>${T('거점 안내','Our locations')}</h2>${A(U('contact'),'문의하기','Contact us','plain-arrow')}</div><div>${[['군포','Gunpo','경기도 군포시 엘에스로 172 한림휴먼타워 306호','306 Hanlim Human Tower, 172 LS-ro, Gunpo-si'],['부산','Busan','부산광역시 해운대구 세실로69번길 24 5층','5F, 24 Sesil-ro 69beon-gil, Haeundae-gu, Busan'],['포항','Pohang','경상북도 포항시 남구 운하로 266 첨단해양R&D센터 801호','801 Advanced Marine R&D Center, 266 Unha-ro, Nam-gu, Pohang']].map((x,i)=>`<article><small>0${i+1}</small><h3>${T(x[0],x[1])}</h3><p>${T(x[2],x[3])}</p></article>`).join('')}</div></section>`}
